\n| [react-router](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router) | `7.15.1` | `7.16.0` |\n| [react-router-dom](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom) | `7.15.1` | `7.16.0` |\n| [eslint-plugin-mdx](https://github.com/mdx-js/eslint-mdx) | `3.7.0` | `3.8.1` |\n| [lint-staged](https://github.com/lint-staged/lint-staged) | `17.0.5` | `17.0.7` |\n| [webpack-cli](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-cli) | `7.0.2` | `7.0.3` |\n\n\nUpdates `react` from 19.2.6 to 19.2.7\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/facebook/react/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/facebook/react/commits/v19.2.7/packages/react)\n\nUpdates `react-dom` from 19.2.6 to 19.2.7\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/facebook/react/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/facebook/react/commits/v19.2.7/packages/react-dom)\n\nUpdates `react-router` from 7.15.1 to 7.16.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/packages/react-router/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commits/react-router@7.16.0/packages/react-router)\n\nUpdates `react-router-dom` from 7.15.1 to 7.16.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/packages/react-router-dom/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commits/react-router-dom@7.16.0/packages/react-router-dom)\n\nUpdates `eslint-plugin-mdx` from 3.7.0 to 3.8.1\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/mdx-js/eslint-mdx/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/mdx-js/eslint-mdx/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/mdx-js/eslint-mdx/compare/eslint-plugin-mdx@3.7.0...eslint-plugin-mdx@3.8.1)\n\nUpdates `