https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-template-app/commits/c82a5ffb45950eac0139dcb00be087763583c232/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T22:58:05Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T22:58:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Declare react-dom as a peer dependency (#372)\n\nAdd react-dom 18.x to peerDependencies in the template app, so that new apps created from it share the shell''s copy.\n\nThe app shell provides react-dom through module federation, but the\nOpenMRS rspack config only shares the dependencies an app lists in\npeerDependencies. Without react-dom listed there, the app loads the\ncopy of react-dom bundled into its own build instead of the shell''s.","tree":{"sha":"72fc8d971275ad67fd0b8bdc01e05d6c2d3b4826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-template-app/git/trees/72fc8d971275ad67fd0b8bdc01e05d6c2d3b4826"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-template-app/git/commits/c82a5ffb45950eac0139dcb00be087763583c232","verification":{"payload":"tree 72fc8d971275ad67fd0b8bdc01e05d6c2d3b4826\nparent 32b40dbe872f041d62486417a09553b407e46551\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1790636285 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790636285 -0400\n\n(fix) Declare react-dom as a peer dependency (#372)\n\nAdd react-dom 18.x to peerDependencies in the template app, so that new apps created from it share the shell''s copy.\n\nThe app shell provides react-dom through module federation, but the\nOpenMRS rspack config only shares the dependencies an app lists in\npeerDependencies.