","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gashcrumb","id":351660,"login":"gashcrumb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTY2MA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/a0d6110d5a49129b841378c3674efc0dc07e1a41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T11:20:02Z","email":"gashcrumb@gmail.com","name":"Stan Lewis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T09:32:55Z","email":"gashcrumb@gmail.com","name":"Stan Lewis"},"message":"feat(github-pull-requests): add new frontend system support via an /alpha entry point\n\nThe plugin had no new frontend system support, so apps on the new system had\nto keep it on the compatibility layer.\n\nAdds a `src/alpha.tsx` entry point exposing the GitHub Pull Requests client as an\n`ApiBlueprint` extension, the entity cards as `EntityCardBlueprint` extensions and\na ready-made `/github-pull-requests` tab as an `EntityContentBlueprint` extension.\nThe old frontend system exports are untouched, so adopters can migrate when they are ready.\n\nThe cards carry the annotation filters that previously had to be wired up in the app\nwith `EntitySwitch`. The tab provides a full view of pull requests for entities with\nthe `github.com/project-slug` annotation.\n\nIncludes comprehensive test coverage using modern `@backstage/frontend-test-utils`\ntesting APIs with proper MSW v2 setup and authentication mocking.\n\n`PullRequestsPage`, `HomePageRequestedReviewsCard`, and `HomePageYourOpenPullRequestsCard`\nare left out: the standalone page needs `PageBlueprint` which is not yet available in\nBackstage 1.44.2, and the home page cards need `HomePageWidgetBlueprint`, which requires\nBackstage 1.48 or above while this repository is on 1.44.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stan Lewis <gashcrumb@gmail.com>\nAssisted-By: google-vertex/claude-sonnet-4-5@20250929\n\nrh-pre-commit.version: 2.4.0\nrh-pre-commit.check-secrets: ENABLED","tree":{"sha":"12ed7c2634e0ef4919bffa0e5b2949d826dcd105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/git/trees/12ed7c2634e0ef4919bffa0e5b2949d826dcd105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/git/commits/a0d6110d5a49129b841378c3674efc0dc07e1a41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/351660?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gashcrumb","id":351660,"login":"gashcrumb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTY2MA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gashcrumb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commit/a0d6110d5a49129b841378c3674efc0dc07e1a41","node_id":"C_kwDOFl4HeNoAKGEwZDYxMTBkNWE0OTEyOWI4NDEzNzhjMzY3NGVmYzBkYzA