hOWQwOGU1YmY2MDJiM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commit/d29316f40dbf87dfa6a0281a7a86276f5cded5b2","sha":"d29316f40dbf87dfa6a0281a7a86276f5cded5b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/d29316f40dbf87dfa6a0281a7a86276f5cded5b2"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commit/82a2409ced1c6768f43f066adc22ad048c4fa190","sha":"82a2409ced1c6768f43f066adc22ad048c4fa190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/82a2409ced1c6768f43f066adc22ad048c4fa190"}],"sha":"581effa8618676a8a48222e67a9d08e5bf602b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/581effa8618676a8a48222e67a9d08e5bf602b3d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/82a2409ced1c6768f43f066adc22ad048c4fa190/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T07:32:26Z","email":"benjamin.david@kereis.com","name":"benjamin-david-kereis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T07:32:26Z","email":"benjamin.david@kereis.com","name":"benjamin-david-kereis"},"message":"feat(jira): add new frontend system support via an /alpha entry point\n\nThe plugin had no new frontend system support, so apps on the new system had\nto keep it on the compatibility layer.\n\nAdds a `src/alpha.tsx` entry point exposing the Jira client as an\n`ApiBlueprint` extension, the three entity cards as `EntityCardBlueprint`\nextensions and a ready-made `/jira` tab as an `EntityContentBlueprint`\nextension. The old frontend system exports are untouched, so adopters can\nmigrate when they are ready.\n\nThe cards carry the annotation filters that previously had to be wired up in\nthe app with `EntitySwitch`. The tab is shipped disabled so that installing\nthe plugin never adds a tab an adopter did not ask for.\n\n`HomePageMyJiraTicketsCard` is left out: it needs `HomePageWidgetBlueprint`,\nwhich req