}],"sha":"31f9365800d4f1495d581088c5f5ce079bb103aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/31f9365800d4f1495d581088c5f5ce079bb103aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/373898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robbat2","id":373898,"login":"robbat2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzg5OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/f1b92391293c950554a972bc4feab56ce46f46a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:05:12Z","email":"rjohnson@coreweave.com","name":"Robin H. Johnson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T22:07:50Z","email":"rjohnson@coreweave.com","name":"Robin H. Johnson"},"message":"feat(iframe): add wrapAnnotationFromConfig factory for config-driven prefixes\n\nAdd a factory helper that reads the URL prefix from a frontend-visible\nconfiguration value rather than hard-coding it at the call site. Useful\nwhen the iframe host should differ between environments without\nrecompiling: put the value in app-config.yaml under a key marked\n`@visibility: frontend`, then call the factory from a component with\naccess to `configApiRef` and pass the result to `EntityIFrameCard` via\n`transform`. Reads the key with `config.getString` so a missing or\nnon-string value fails fast at factory-call time.\n\nAdds `@backstage/config` as an explicit dependency since `Config` is now\nin the public type surface, and documents both the helper and a richer\n\"write your own factory\" example in the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Robin H. Johnson <rjohnson@coreweave.com>","tree":{"sha":"5039a09b2c44cede0c5f3e5948a469c282f4bffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/git/trees/5039a09b2c44cede0c5f3e5948a469c282f4bffa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/git/commits/f1b92391293c950554a972bc4feab56ce46f46a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 5039a09b2c44cede0c5f3e5948a469c282f4bffa\nparent 21ec753193783c3206385e9659edb54a1eb15d3b\nauthor Robin H. Johnson <rjohnson@coreweave.com> 1779570312 -0700\ncommitter Robin H. Johnson <rjohnson@coreweave.com> 1779574070 -0700\n\nfeat(iframe): add wrapAnnotationFromConfig factory for config-driven prefixes\n\nAdd a factory helper that reads the URL prefix from a frontend-visible\nconfiguration value rather than hard-coding it at the call site. Useful\nwhen the iframe host should differ between environments without\nrecompiling: put the value in app-config.yaml under a key marked\n`@visibility: frontend`, then call the factory from a component with\naccess to `configApiRef` and pass the result to `EntityIFrameCard` via\n`transform`. Reads the key with `config.getString` so a missing or\nnon-string value fails fast at factory-call time.\n\nAdds `@backstage/config` as an explicit dependency since `Config` is now\nin the public type surface, and documents both the helper and a richer\n\"write your own factory\" example in the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Robin H. Johnson <rjohnson@coreweave.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE---