k","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commit/21ec753193783c3206385e9659edb54a1eb15d3b","sha":"21ec753193783c3206385e9659edb54a1eb15d3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/21ec753193783c3206385e9659edb54a1eb15d3b"}],"sha":"f1b92391293c950554a972bc4feab56ce46f46a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/f1b92391293c950554a972bc4feab56ce46f46a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/373898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robbat2","id":373898,"login":"robbat2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzg5OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbat2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/commits/21ec753193783c3206385e9659edb54a1eb15d3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T20:58:18Z","email":"rjohnson@coreweave.com","name":"Robin H. Johnson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:26:56Z","email":"rjohnson@coreweave.com","name":"Robin H. Johnson"},"message":"feat(iframe): allow transforming annotation values into iframe src\n\nAdd an optional `transform` prop on `EntityIFrameCard` / `IFrameCard` for\nthe `srcFromAnnotation` path. The function receives the raw annotation\nvalue plus the entity and returns the final iframe `src`, so entities can\nstore a bare identifier (dashboard id, project slug) instead of the full\nURL. Ships two helper builders: `wrapAnnotation(prefix, suffix?)` for\nfixed prefix/suffix wrapping and `intoTemplate(''https://host/foo/${value}/extra'')`\nfor embedding the value as a substring. The transformed URL still goes\nthrough the existing https-only and `iframe.allowList` checks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Robin H. Johnson <rjohnson@coreweave.com>","tree":{"sha":"862312344615f4650273500bb353cdf48b349065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/git/trees/862312344615f4650273500bb353cdf48b349065"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RoadieHQ/roadie-backstage-plugins/git/commits/21ec753193783c3206385e9659edb54a1eb15d3b","verification":{"payload":"tree 862312344615f4650273500bb353cdf48b349065\nparent 10386d6ee9871d83e1fc2831583e4a6be9eae29e\nauthor Robin H. Johnson <rjohnson@coreweave.com> 1779569898 -0700\ncommitter Robin H. Johnson <rjohnson@coreweave.com> 1779571616 -0700\n\nfeat(iframe): allow transforming annotation values into iframe src\n\nAdd an optional `transform` prop on `EntityIFrameCard` / `IFrameCard` for\nthe `srcFromAnnotation` path. The function receives the raw annotation\nvalue plus the entity and returns the final iframe `src`, so entities can\nstore a bare identifier (dashboard id, project slug) instead of the full\nURL. Ships two helper builders: `wrapAnnotation(prefix, suffix?)` for\nfixed prefix/suffix wrapping and `intoTemplate(''https://host/foo/${value}/extra'')`\nfor embedding the value as a substring. The transformed URL still goes\nthrough the existing https-only and `iframe.allowList` checks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Robin H. Johnson <rjohnson@coreweave.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdF