llowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/fd7c0e889cca48a1fa04c106928fdb501667e531/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T10:01:59Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T10:01:59Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"fix(release): exit explicitly so the orchestrator does not hang\n\nThe nx/release programmatic API opens a connection to the Nx daemon and leaves\nit open, keeping the Node event loop alive. After all release work completed\n(\"Release complete.\"), the process hung instead of exiting. The nx CLI exits\nexplicitly for this reason; since we drive the programmatic API ourselves, call\nprocess.exit(0) on success (failure already exits via die()).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26a95c65d5ad6af5eea6011445f19ccc9d9d3a34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/26a95c65d5ad6af5eea6011445f19ccc9d9d3a34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/fd7c0e889cca48a1fa04c106928fdb501667e531","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/fd7c0e889cca48a1fa04c106928fdb501667e531","node_id":"C_kwDOFp_Hs9oAKGZkN2MwZTg4OWNjYTQ4YTFmYTA0YzEwNjkyOGZkYjUwMTY2N2U1MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/103ae5093731c26685b96c2baad6ed3dfd794036","sha":"103ae5093731c26685b96c2baad6ed3dfd794036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/103ae5093731c26685b96c2baad6ed3dfd794036"}],"sha":"fd7c0e889cca48a1fa04c106928fdb501667e531","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/fd7c0e889cca48a1fa04c106928fdb501667e531"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/103ae5093731c26685b96c2baad6ed3dfd794036/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T09:06:50Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T09:06:50Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"fix(release): drop stale per-project release.version overrides\n\n32 package project.json files carried a legacy\n`release.version.generatorOptions` block (packageRoot=dist/{projectRoot},\ncurrentVersionResolver=git-tag). Because those options differ from the\ngroup-level config, nx release split the projects into multiple generator\nbatches, and with updateDependents=\"auto\" a project that is both a versioned\nmember and an updated dependent (e.g. preset-workspace) got its version data\nappended twice — \"Version data key already exists in version data\".\n\nThe overrides are also wrong for our flow: packageRoot=dist/{projectRoot} would\nmake the version step target the dist manifest instead of the source. Versioning\nnow reads the source package.json (default packageRoot) and publishing reads\ndist via the nx-release-publish packageRoot targetDefault. The resolver settings\nare already the group defaults. Removing the blocks unifies all packages into a\nsingle batch and resolves the duplication error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5349c03c44e6fd807b4b69d7e1ba117b47ac4f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/a5349c03c44e6fd807b4b69d7e1ba117b47ac4f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/103ae5093731c26685b96c2baad6ed3dfd794036","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/103ae5093731c26685b96c2baad6ed3dfd794036","node_id":"C_kwDOFp_Hs9oAKDEwM2FlNTA5MzczMWMyNjY4NWI5NmMyYmFhZDZlZDNkZmQ3OTQwMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/8be2c186fe80888be8bae01ae07b0969d5d89692","sha":"8be2c186fe80888be8bae01ae07b0969d5d89692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/8be2c186fe80888be8bae01ae07b0969d5d89692"}],"sha":"103ae5093731c26685b96c2baad6ed3dfd794036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/103ae5093731c26685b96c2baad6ed3dfd794036"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/8be2c186fe80888be8bae01ae07b0969d5d89692/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T08:36:39Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T08:36:39Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"fix(release): exclude demos/** from the packages release group\n\nThe demo fixtures under demos/ (e.g. open-api-service-app-angular-accordion)\ncarry a legacy \"packages\" tag but have no package.json, so nx release tried to\nversion/publish them and failed. Lerna excluded them implicitly by only scanning\nthe packages/ workspace globs. Add a \"!demos/**\" directory exclusion to the\npackages release group so any project under demos/ is excluded regardless of tags.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b36947f596e43319246019363747ae1970f06f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/b36947f596e43319246019363747ae1970f06f15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/8be2c186fe80888be8bae01ae07b0969d5d89692","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/8be2c186fe80888be8bae01ae07b0969d5d89692","node_id":"C_kwDOFp_Hs9oAKDhiZTJjMTg2ZmU4MDg4OGJlOGJhZTAxYWUwN2IwOTY5ZDVkODk2OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/d367aa83ce65a0bed17bb326bfe1f3a72363847c","sha":"d367aa83ce65a0bed17bb326bfe1f3a72363847c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/d367aa83ce65a0bed17bb326bfe1f3a72363847c"}],"sha":"8be2c186fe80888be8bae01ae07b0969d5d89692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/8be2c186fe80888be8bae01ae07b0969d5d89692"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/d367aa83ce65a0bed17bb326bfe1f3a72363847c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T07:43:12Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T07:43:12Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"build(release): replace Lerna with native nx release\n\nReplace the Lerna 9 + custom bash hook release pipeline with a programmatic\nnx release orchestrator (tools/scripts/release.mjs) that preserves the goal of\nevery former pre-step: branch-driven prerelease/dist-tag selection, the preflight\ngate, build/test/lint validation, internal @rxap/* dependency pinning, the\nnx-migrations packageGroup regeneration, README/doc generation, the dist\ntransforms (theme export, workspace-marker strip), GitLab release creation, and\nthe rxap umbrella second pass.\n\n- nx.json: independent release groups (packages, rxap), conventional-commit\n  versioning with the git-tag resolver (disk fallback), ^ version prefix,\n  per-project changelogs, granular version/changelog git config, and\n  nx-release-publish.packageRoot = dist/{projectRoot} (publish from dist)\n- package.json: drop the lerna dep and the lerna lifecycle scripts; add\n  `release` / `release:dry`\n- remove lerna.json, tools/scripts/lerna/*, tools/scripts/publish.mjs\n- RELEASE_WORKFLOW.md: document the new yarn release flow\n\nGitLab releases are created via a custom step (Nx 20.5.0 supports only GitHub\nnatively); upgrading to Nx 21+ later can replace it with createRelease: gitlab.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16c4d338a3c24aeb7fce6401393e8850e585e825","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/16c4d338a3c24aeb7fce6401393e8850e585e825"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/d367aa83ce65a0bed17bb326bfe1f3a72363847c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/d367aa83ce65a0bed17bb326bfe1f3a72363847c","node_id":"C_kwDOFp_Hs9oAKGQzNjdhYTgzY2U2NWEwYmVkMTdiYjMyNmJmZTFmM2E3MjM2Mzg0N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/463b9cb34300e609a407b2d1d3507d13e1f0704a","sha":"463b9cb34300e609a407b2d1d3507d13e1f0704a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/463b9cb34300e609a407b2d1d3507d13e1f0704a"}],"sha":"d367aa83ce65a0bed17bb326bfe1f3a72363847c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/d367aa83ce65a0bed17bb326bfe1f3a72363847c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/463b9cb34300e609a407b2d1d3507d13e1f0704a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:18:52Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:18:52Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"fix(plugin-nestjs): resolve package-json deps via retry to avoid empty output\n\nThe generate-package-json target runs concurrently with ^build, which rewrites\ndependency projects'' package.json files. The executor resolved its dependency\nlist through the synchronous, non-retry path and silently dropped any dependency\ncaught mid-rewrite, producing an empty dependencies map while still reporting\nsuccess. A direct re-run worked because nothing competed for the files.\n\nSwitch to the existing async GetAllPackageDependenciesForProjectWihRetry, retry\nthe whole resolution (linear backoff) when it returns empty despite local\ndependencies in the graph, and throw if it never resolves instead of writing a\nbroken package.json. Also warn when get-direct-package-dependencies drops a\ndependency, so the previously silent filtering is visible in the build log.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92071dd7cae43631d59a1d7c5244eb35866ad269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/92071dd7cae43631d59a1d7c5244eb35866ad269"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/463b9cb34300e609a407b2d1d3507d13e1f0704a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/463b9cb34300e609a407b2d1d3507d13e1f0704a","node_id":"C_kwDOFp_Hs9oAKDQ2M2I5Y2IzNDMwMGU2MDlhNDA3YjJkMWQzNTA3ZDEzZTFmMDcwNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https