odules'' / ''__dirname physical path'' /\n''dynamic require from node_modules'' entries across the affected TODO.md files. The\nseparate peer-install lifecycle/ordering issue (deps not installed until after the\ngenerator finishes) is kept where present, annotated as still-open.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac141cc3da2369a13e7ada9886385f586de7eef7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/ac141cc3da2369a13e7ada9886385f586de7eef7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/e93dce10ba98621c87e29e83766b89a9300e1fa6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/e93dce10ba98621c87e29e83766b89a9300e1fa6","node_id":"C_kwDOFp_Hs9oAKGU5M2RjZTEwYmE5ODYyMWM4N2UyOWU4Mzc2NmI4OWE5MzAwZTFmYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/4efd040609dcfd93acab4a14532f01a50e4dacab","sha":"4efd040609dcfd93acab4a14532f01a50e4dacab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/4efd040609dcfd93acab4a14532f01a50e4dacab"}],"sha":"e93dce10ba98621c87e29e83766b89a9300e1fa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/e93dce10ba98621c87e29e83766b89a9300e1fa6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/4efd040609dcfd93acab4a14532f01a50e4dacab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T16:25:37Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T16:25:37Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"fix(generators): read package.json and node_modules from disk, not the virtual Tree\n\nEvery init generator resolved its own package.json via relative(tree.root, __dirname)\nand inspected peer packages under node_modules through the Nx virtual Tree\n(tree.exists/tree.read). The virtual Tree only tracks workspace source and excludes\nnode_modules, so those checks always failed: the generator bailed out early and the\npeer init-generator loop never ran. Read the package''s own package.json and all\nnode_modules peer files directly from the physical filesystem (fs + absolute paths\nunder tree.root), and require peer generators by absolute path. The workspace root\npackage.json continues to use the Tree. Applied identically to all 117 init generators\n(this also fixes the missing .some() devDependency-coercion guard in\npackages/utilities, which the earlier batch regex did not match).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97ec2632287a68c13a94d2053a84f17fd00ff2eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/97ec2632287a68c13a94d2053a84f17fd00ff2eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/4efd040609dcfd93acab4a14532f01a50e4dacab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/4efd040609dcfd93acab4a14532f01a50e4dacab","node_id":"C_kwDOFp_Hs9oAKDRlZmQwNDA2MDlkY2ZkOTNhY2FiNGExNDUzMmYwMWE1MGU0ZGFjYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/f4a3cad41ce5ae9c08dfc9f21911603577dc1291","sha":"f4a3cad41ce5ae9c08dfc9f21911603577dc1291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/f4a3cad41ce5ae9c08dfc9f21911603577dc1291"}],"sha":"4efd040609dcfd93acab4a14532f01a50e4dacab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/4efd040609dcfd93acab4a14532f01a50e4dacab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/f4a3cad41ce5ae9c08dfc9f21911603577dc1291/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T16:00:13Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T16:00:13Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"fix(utilities): back @Deprecated member storage with a WeakMap\n\nThe @Deprecated property decorator stored values under an own ''__deprecated__<key>''\nproperty, so Object.keys()/JSON.stringify() emitted the prefixed name instead of the\nreal property name. Store values in a per-instance WeakMap keyed by the instance so no\n__deprecated__ key leaks onto the object. Adds a spec asserting the key does not leak.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a2b2fd262691a8d2d76fc1d0f6177a5519f3ea3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/4a2b2fd262691a8d2d76fc1d0f6177a5519f3ea3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/f4a3cad41ce5ae9c08dfc9f21911603577dc1291","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/f4a3cad41ce5ae9c08dfc9f21911603577dc1291","node_id":"C_kwDOFp_Hs9oAKGY0YTNjYWQ0MWNlNWFlOWMwOGRmYzlmMjE5MTE2MDM1NzdkYzEyOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rxap-mirror/packages/commit/b63db3e7a914cc7feb799b844d355d33e2b6bf20","sha":"b63db3e7a914cc7feb799b844d355d33e2b6bf20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/