se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/bea104c2bdab0ddcba2a9a0dea30f1ffd4fddd5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T13:53:48Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T13:53:48Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"fix(ngx-pub-sub): correct GC init guard, config token mappings and GC iteration\n\nstartGarbageCollector set the initialized flag before checking it, so it\nalways returned early and the collector never ran. withMaxCacheSize and\nwithGarbageCollectorInterval bound the wrong tokens (DISABLE_* instead of\nCACHE_SIZE / GARBAGE_COLLECTOR_INTERVAL), silently disabling the subsystems.\nrunGarbageCollector spliced during forEach, skipping entries; iterate backward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eef12a264ad0ed67af1ee1110a98dc74e140ac59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/eef12a264ad0ed67af1ee1110a98dc74e140ac59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/bea104c2bdab0ddcba2a9a0dea30f1ffd4fddd5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46753218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mmuenker","id":46753218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4"