218,"login":"mmuenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUzMjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mmuenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/commits/759404ebe7ef58e166fa6a43104de45f96259b1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T13:34:09Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T13:34:09Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"fix(generators): match package name with .some() in init devDependency coercion\n\nThe second dependency-coercion block in every init generator passed a bare\narray literal as the `if` condition instead of testing the package name\nagainst the regex patterns. Since an array literal is always truthy, any\nnon-devDependency package was incorrectly moved into `devDependencies`,\nconflicting with the `@rxap/nest`/`@rxap/ngx` block directly above it.\n\nAdd the missing `.some((rx) => rx.test(packageName))` predicate, mirroring\nthe first coercion block. Applied identically across all 116 affected init\ngenerators.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3d98e42dc52a73ec348d4673c7e418e39233bbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/f3d98e42dc52a73ec348d4673c7e418e39233bbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/759404ebe7ef58e166fa6a43104de45f96259b1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent