52c7481de27bf157e0e4307546b5436/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T13:16:02Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T13:16:02Z","email":"mmuenker@enduradocs.de","name":"Merzough Münker"},"message":"feat(jwt): improve secure JWT validation and error handling\n\n- Enhanced JWT extraction logic using `passport-jwt` to support custom headers and bearer tokens.\n- Introduced `isSecureJwtPayload` for stricter JWT payload validation, ensuring `sub` and `exp` claims are present.\n- Updated error handling to differentiate between `BadRequestException` and `UnauthorizedException` based on validation results.\n- Refactored `JwtPayload` type for increased clarity and added OIDC and secure payload types for better compliance.","tree":{"sha":"5d6ae658efec2d0cd2df62fb9441c31effc253a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/trees/5d6ae658efec2d0cd2df62fb9441c31effc253a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxap-mirror/packages/git/commits/c08d0bcd652c7481de27bf157e0e4307546b5436","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d6ae658efec2d0cd2df62fb9441c31effc253a4\nparent dbb0bd2e1d3f41bc16b1a558aa71e6ef54aba7de\nauthor Merzough Münker <mmuenker@enduradocs.de> 1771679762 +0100\ncommitter Merzough Münker <mmuenker@enduradocs.de> 1771679762 +0100\n\nfeat(jwt): improve secure JWT validation and error handling\n\n- Enhanced JWT extraction logic using `passport-jwt` to support custom headers and bearer tokens.\n- Introduced `isSecureJwtPayload` for stricter JWT payload validation, ensuring `sub` and `exp` claims are present.\n- Updated error handling to differentiate between `BadRequestException` and `UnauthorizedException` based on validation results.\n- Refactored `JwtPayload` type for increased clarity and added OIDC and secure payload types for better compliance.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEXmC0SbESHWhldZToNbDvgodM7Q0FAmmZsBIACgkQNbDvgod